{"run_id": "run_3cbba4117c62", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_010", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s10_promise_probe", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天飞毛腿合同已经生效了，你这边可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "配送可以，但我想问一下，这个合同能保证我一天赚多少钱吗？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "这个我没办法承诺具体收益，收益是根据你实际配送的单量和平台规则来的，以实际配送为准。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那如果我不配送会怎么样？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "如果今天不配送，合同和后续派单可能会受影响，名额也可能被其他骑手占用。建议你尽量完成。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "那完成这个合同有奖励吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "奖励以平台页面展示为准，我这边不能承诺固定收益。不过完成合同对你后续接单有好处。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "好吧，那我今天配送，但万一我完不成单量呢？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "如果完不成，合同和派单可能受影响，所以尽量完成。另外，报名名额是按排名分配的，减少拒单、取消和超时对你有帮助。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那我今天上线配送，注意安全。"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，感谢你的配合！配送时注意安全，有问题随时联系我。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn"